Bundled QNN runtime
-------------------
The SDK includes unchanged Qualcomm QNN user-space runtime components beside the model library.
Their original terms and notices are in sdk/lib/qnn248/LICENSE.pdf, NOTICE.txt and QNN_NOTICE.txt.
The statically embedded Pandora QNN integration code is Apache-2.0; see sdk/lib/LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.
Aidlux LMS and compatible BSP/FastRPC, drivers, firmware and system libraries remain external prerequisites.

